   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(33,1)><sp(2)>だが、それが仇となり、<im(10)>周辺<im(11)>の制空権は\n完全に彼らに抑えられてしまっている。\nそこで君たちの力が必要なわけだ。",
   "en": "<op(33,1)><sp(2)>However, that backfired. They now hold<im(10)><im(11)>\ncomplete control of surrounding airspace.\nThat is why we need your help.",
